.IX Title "PMDAPDNS 1"
.TH PMDAPDNS 1 "Performance Co-Pilot" 7.2.0 "Performance Co-Pilot"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pmdapdns \- PowerDNS performance metrics domain agent (PMDA)
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBpmdapdns\fR is a Performance Metrics Domain Agent (PMDA) which exports
metric values from the PowerDNS authoritative daemon as well as the recursive
resolver.
.SH INSTALLATION
.IX Header "INSTALLATION"
If you want access to the names and values for the PowerDNS performance
metrics, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns
\&        # ./Install
.Ve
.PP
If you want to undo the installation, do the following as root:
.PP
.Vb 2
\&        # cd $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns
\&        # ./Remove
.Ve
.PP
\&\fBpmdapdns\fR is launched by \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) and should never be executed
directly.  The Install and Remove scripts notify \fBpmcd\fR\|(1) when
the agent is installed or removed.
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
.IX Header "FILES"
.ie n .IP $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns/Install 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_PMDAS_DIR\fR/pdns/Install 4
.IX Item "$PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns/Install"
installation script for the \fBpmdapdns\fR agent
.ie n .IP $PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns/Remove 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_PMDAS_DIR\fR/pdns/Remove 4
.IX Item "$PCP_PMDAS_DIR/pdns/Remove"
undo installation script for the \fBpmdapdns\fR agent
.ie n .IP $PCP_LOG_DIR/pmcd/pdns.log 4
.el .IP \f(CR$PCP_LOG_DIR\fR/pmcd/pdns.log 4
.IX Item "$PCP_LOG_DIR/pmcd/pdns.log"
default log file for error messages from \fBpmdapdns\fR
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBpmcd\fR\|(1), \fBpdns_control\fR\|(8), and \fBrec_control\fR\|(1).
